# Wesnoth Access end-to-end test: moving towards a target with Ctrl+Enter.
#ARGS: -t access_test

wait-for 180000 Your turn
wait-dialog 20000 transient_message
key Enter
wait 800

# Ctrl+Enter without a selection explains what to do.
mark
key Ctrl+Enter
expect Select one of your units first

# F7 without a selection explains what to do.
mark
key F7
expect No attack options
expect No unit is selected

# Select the Spearman: the first selection gives a short how-to.
key F3
key F3
mark
key Enter
expect Selected your Spearman
expect Control Enter

# The village at 4,2 is reachable: the description says so.
mark
key F5
expect village
mark
key X
expect reachable

# The Grunt's hex is occupied: the closest reachable hex is offered.
mark
key F4
key X
expect closest reachable hex
expect 1 away

# Ctrl+Enter moves next to the Grunt with the game's own movement.
mark
key Ctrl+Enter
wait-for 15000 moved to
expect your Spearman Pike moved to
# The target is an enemy: the unit stays selected and Enter attacks.
wait-for 5000 Next to
expect Press Enter to open the attack dialog
mark
key C
expect 7, 4
key Enter
wait-dialog 15000 unit_attack
expect Chance to kill
key Escape
wait 1000

quit
